        "cooked": "<p>OPPE syllabus is from week 1 to 9.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-ds-students\" data-username=\"parthivn28\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"191934\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://dub1.discourse-cdn.com/flex013/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/parthivn28/48/132632_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> parthivn28:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Also as its a re oppe would i also get two attempts? and first exam is on dec 1 st right?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yes, you will get two attempts. Please check grading document for exam dates.</p>\n<p>Exam is on 6th December</p>",
